        <div class="relative group">

            <div
                class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[42px] border border-[#ebe3a7]/38 shadow-2xl">
                <img decoding="async" src="/resources/images/care/succ-2.jpg" alt="Succulent plants"
                    class="homepage-hero-media h-[620px] w-full object-cover transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#113e14]/35"></div>
            </div>
        </div>


        <div
            class="homepage-lively-card relative rounded-[34px] border border-[#ebe3a7]/48 bg-[#ebe3a7]/86 p-8 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-2xl sm:p-10 lg:p-12">
            <div
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14] px-5 py-2 text-sm font-black tracking-wide text-[#ebe3a7] shadow-sm mb-8">

                <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#a8b841]"></div>
                Learn about:
            </div>


            <h2 class="font-abril text-4xl leading-tight text-[#113e14] md:text-5xl mb-8">
                Essential Care for
                Succulent Plants
            </h2>
            <div class="text-[#416543] text-lg font-semibold leading-[2rem] mb-10">

                Succulents are low-maintenance,
                water-storing plants known for their
                thick, fleshy leaves and geometric beauty.

                <br><br>

                Perfect for indoor and outdoor decoration,
                they bring freshness and elegance with
                minimal care requirements.

            </div>


            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-5">
                @!component('components/care/metric-card', {
                    icon: 'resources/images/care/hand.png',
                    title: 'Low Maintenance',
                    text: 'Easy to care for daily',
                })
                @!component('components/care/metric-card', {
                    icon: 'resources/images/care/11.png',
                    title: 'Bright Spaces',
                    text: 'Thrives with sunlight',
                })
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</div>








