                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>




<div class="w-full py-28 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
        <div class="text-center mb-20">
            <div
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-[#ebe3a7]/82 px-6 py-3 text-[#113e14] text-sm tracking-[0.25em] uppercase shadow-lg">
                Succulent Care Guide
            </div>

            <h2 class="mt-8 font-abril text-5xl leading-tight text-white md:text-6xl">
                Essential Care Tips
                <span class="text-[#ebe3a7]">
                    for Succulents
                </span>
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-6 text-white/80 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg leading-relaxed">
                Learn how to maintain healthy, vibrant,
                and long-lasting succulent plants with proper care.
            </p>
        </div>


        <div class="care-tip-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-10">


            <div class="group relative">

                <div class="relative h-full bg-[#ebe3a7]/78 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-white/20 rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden
                shadow-[0_20px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-500">


                    <div class="relative p-8 pb-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">

                            <div
                                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#113e14] text-[#ebe3a7] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-poppins font-bold shadow-lg">
                                01
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="text-3xl font-poppins font-bold text-[#113e14] leading-tight">
                            Proper Watering
                        </h3>
                    </div>


                    <div class="mx-8 h-[1px] bg-white/20"></div>
                    <div class="p-8">

                        <p class="text-[#416543] font-semibold leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Succulents need very little water.
                            It is recommended to let the soil dry
                            out completely before watering again.
                            Water deeply so that water flows out
                            of the pot's drainage holes. After that,
                            the soil should dry out again before
                            the next watering.
                        </p>

                        <p class="text-[#113e14]/72 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                            Frequent shallow waterings can cause weak
                            or deformed growth - In winter, succulents
                            need less water - Excess moisture promotes
                            disease and rot
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="group relative">

                <div
                    class="relative h-full bg-[#ebe3a7]/82 border border-[#ebe3a7]/48 rounded-[34px] overflow-hidden shadow-xl backdrop-blur-2xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">

                    <div class="relative p-8 pb-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
                            <div
                                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#113e14] text-[#ebe3a7] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-poppins font-bold shadow-lg">
                                02
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="text-3xl font-poppins font-bold text-[#113e14] leading-tight">
                            Soil and Nutrition
                        </h3>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mx-8 h-[1px] bg-white/20"></div>
                    <div class="p-8">
                        <p class="text-[#416543] font-semibold leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Use well-draining soil, preferably a cactus
                            or succulent mix.
                        </p>

                        <p class="text-[#113e14]/72 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                            Most succulents and cacti grow best in sandy,
                            well-drained soil. It is recommended to use
                            potting mixes combined with coarse sand to
                            improve drainage. They also note that pots
                            should have drainage holes to prevent water
                            from becoming trapped. Excess moisture can
                            cause root rot and serious damage to the plant.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="group relative">

                <div
                    class="relative h-full bg-[#ebe3a7]/82 border border-[#ebe3a7]/48 rounded-[34px] overflow-hidden shadow-xl backdrop-blur-2xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">

                    <div class="relative p-8 pb-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
                            <div
                                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#113e14] text-[#ebe3a7] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-poppins font-bold shadow-lg">
                                03
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="text-3xl font-poppins font-bold text-[#113e14] leading-tight">
                            Fertilization
                        </h3>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mx-8 h-[1px] bg-white/20"></div>
                    <div class="p-8">
                        <p class="text-[#416543] font-semibold leading-relaxed mb-6">

                            Succulents require few nutrients.
                            It is recommended to fertilize cacti
                            and succulents only once or twice a year,
                            especially during spring and summer.
                            It is important to note that many succulents
                            tolerate dry, warm conditions. It is also
                            worth noting that during the winter, some
                            species prefer cooler temperatures and
                            lower humidity.

                        </p>

                        <p class="text-[#113e14]/72 leading-relaxed text-sm">

                            It is also recommended to:
                            - use diluted fertilizers
                            - use fertilizers with more phosphorus
                            than nitrogen
                            - avoid over-fertilizing

                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="group relative">

                <div
                    class="relative h-full bg-[#ebe3a7]/82 border border-[#ebe3a7]/48 rounded-[34px] overflow-hidden shadow-xl backdrop-blur-2xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">

                    <div class="relative p-8 pb-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">

                            <div
                                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#113e14] text-[#ebe3a7] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-poppins font-bold shadow-lg">
                                04
                            </div>

                        </div>

                        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-[#113e14] leading-tight">
                            Growing in Pots
                        </h3>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mx-8 h-[1px] bg-white/20"></div>
                    <div class="p-8">
                        <p class="text-[#416543] font-semibold leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Succulents do very well in containers
                            and pots.
                        </p>

                        <p class="text-[#113e14]/72 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                            However, the soil in pots can dry out
                            quickly, so it's important to check the
                            moisture level regularly. Overwatering
                            is also one of the most common mistakes
                            when growing succulents.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="group relative md:col-span-2 xl:col-span-2">

                <div
                    class="relative h-full bg-[#ebe3a7]/82 border border-[#ebe3a7]/48 rounded-[34px] overflow-hidden shadow-xl backdrop-blur-2xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">
                    <div class="relative p-8 pb-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
                            <div
                                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#113e14] text-[#ebe3a7] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-poppins font-bold shadow-lg">
                                05
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-[#113e14] leading-tight">
                            Pests and Diseases
                        </h3>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mx-8 h-[1px] bg-white/20"></div>

                    <div class="p-8">
                        <p class="text-[#416543] font-semibold leading-relaxed mb-6">

                            When caring for succulents, it's important
                            to keep in mind that pests aren't very common,
                            but they can still appear:

                            - mealybugs
                            - scale insects
                            - mites

                        </p>

                        <p class="text-[#113e14]/72 leading-relaxed text-sm">

                            To control them, they recommend:
                            - wiping away pests with cotton and alcohol
                            - maintaining good lighting
                            - avoiding overwatering
                            - constantly monitoring the plants

                            <br><br>

                            It is also important to know that excessive
                            humidity can cause mold and rot.

                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>






<hr class="mx-10 border-t-2 border-white/20 mb-24">

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24">

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-center">


        <div class="relative group">
            <div class="absolute -top-5 -left-5 w-full h-full border-2 border-[#113e14] rounded-[2.5rem]">
            </div>

            <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-[0_25px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]">
                <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/resources/images/care/succ-1.jpg" alt="Succulent care"
                    class="w-full h-[500px] object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-700">

                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#113e14]/35">
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>


        <div>
            <div class="text-[#113e14] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sm font-bold mb-5">
                Succulent Plant Care
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
                General Tips for
                <span class="text-[#ebe3a7]">
                    Caring for Succulents
                </span>
            </h2>


            <div class="space-y-5 text-white/85 text-lg leading-relaxed">
                <p>
                    The most important steps for caring for your succulents are:
                </p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
                        <p>provide plenty of light</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
                        <p>use sandy, well-drained soil</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
                        <p>use pots with drainage holes</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
                        <p>let the soil dry out between waterings</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
                        <p>avoid excess moisture</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
                        <p>fertilize a few times a year</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
                        <p>check for pests and diseases</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#113e14]"></div>
                        <p>avoid waterlogging</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <button class="mt-10 px-8 py-4 bg-[#dca15d] hover:bg-[#ebe3a7] text-[#113e14] font-bold text-lg rounded-2xl
                 shadow-[0_15px_35px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
                get a plant
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
@end
